Z||000000||AusFiero||04-30-2001||11:21 AM||||This is a picture of what is probably Australias most modified Pontiac. It was originally a 4 door sedan and has been converted to 2 door, chopped, roof pancaked, tubbed and numerous other body mods have been carried out.<P>It isn't just a show pony though as the heart of the beast is a 720hp 572ci big block Chev. Runs on standard unleaded fuel and eats everything in its path. It is regularly driven on the streets and is owned by a member of the Pontiac Car Club of Australia. <P>It is pictured here leaving the line during sprint racing at the Pontiac Nationals at Gundagai NSW Australia held over easter long weekend.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/launch.jpg"> ||||reg||14
Z||000001||Pontiaddict||04-30-2001||06:23 PM||||Any idea on the year? I'll guess a 59.<BR>I'd prefer a Poncho motor, but it's cool anyways. How fast is it?||||reg||1
